Screenshot 2 — Duplicate Payment Detection
What it shows: 
Vendors paid the same exact dollar amount multiple times, including how many times it occurred and the date range.

Why it matters (Audit Control Test):
This simulates a standard audit analytic:
- possible duplicate payments
- repeated reimbursements
